sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Action: submit, decision, resubmit
    participant DB as Database transaction
    participant API as Edge Function
    participant NW as notify-worker
    participant EJ as EmailJS
    participant CO as Contributor inbox
    participant CR as Scheduler every 10 minutes
    A->>DB: Change status + write audit event + queue email row
    Note over DB: All three commit together or none do
    DB-->>A: Done
    API->>NW: Wake the worker
    NW->>DB: Claim due rows (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    Note over NW,DB: Two workers can never send the same email
    NW->>NW: Render the email template
    NW->>EJ: Send through the REST API using the private key
    alt Delivered
        EJ-->>CO: Email arrives
        NW->>DB: Mark row sent
    else Failed
        NW->>DB: attempts + 1, try again later
        Note over NW,DB: Waits 1, 5, 25, 125 minutes. After 5 attempts the row is marked failed and stays visible
    end
    CR->>NW: POST with x-cron-secret
    Note over CR,NW: Picks up anything still waiting
